WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.950
- Alright, before we roll the credits.

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.140
I've got one last story
I can't wait to share.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.343
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.860
Y'all get ready, for some
awesome female power.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.880
This story is crazy.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.340
This summer four women
braved the open water

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.989
in a thirty foot boat in
the Great Pacific Race.

00:00:16.989 --> 00:00:19.680
They rode from San Francisco to Honolulu.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.190
In thirty-four days, fourteen
hours and twenty minutes.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.629
Breaking a world record.

00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:27.647
Say hello to the women of team Lat 35.

00:00:27.647 --> 00:00:30.320
Adrienne, Brooke, DJ and Libby.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.130
(audience cheers)

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.143
Congratulations, y'all.

00:00:35.524 --> 00:00:36.731
- Hi, Kelly.

00:00:36.731 --> 00:00:39.060
- This is incredible.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.731
I feel so lazy, like talking to you.

00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:43.800
But Adrienne and Libby,
I'll start with y'all.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.320
Tell us more about the
boat and the conditions.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.819
- So, you got it right
the boat is thirty feet

00:00:48.819 --> 00:00:52.120
and we have two cabins
that we would sleep in.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.388
We spend two hours
rowing and then two hours

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:58.170
doing other things.

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:01.320
Twenty-four hours a day,
for thirty-four days.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.670
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.590
- In our off shifts,
when we're not rowing.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.780
We kinda do everything
else and it involves like

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:10.419
making food, cleaning the
boat, fixing equipment.

00:01:10.419 --> 00:01:13.770
Any incoming storms,
you got to prep it for.

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.690
So you kinda just have
to like go with the flow.

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:17.970
With everything that comes your way.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:18.990
Which is quite exciting.

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:21.330
When you're out there
just all on your own.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.069
- I love that you say that's exciting.

00:01:24.069 --> 00:01:27.810
I would be terrified of a
big storm on a little boat.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:28.830
But, Brooke.

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:30.750
I hear that the Olympics
might be in your future.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.710
Right?

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:34.389
- Yeah, before this I
was training full time.

00:01:34.389 --> 00:01:36.630
In hopes of making the National Team.

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.670
And when I was out in
the middle of the ocean

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.118
I realized I had some unfinished business

00:01:41.118 --> 00:01:42.270
with flat water.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.130
So, I'm getting back into training.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.869
In hopes of going to the Paris 24

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:47.617
or Los Angeles 28.

00:01:47.617 --> 00:01:50.160
- Wow, well congratulations.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:50.993
It's incredible.

00:01:50.993 --> 00:01:52.470
Thank you for showing us what we are

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.310
actually capable of.

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:55.170
So, well I don't have to.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.160
Alright so, DJ.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.350
Y'all are raising money, right?

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.640
- Yeah, so as Libby described.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.640
We had a pretty grueling schedule.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.869
But, we did end up having
actually a ton of fun.

00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:09.090
We were able to listen to lots of music.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:09.923
Sing a lot.

00:02:09.923 --> 00:02:11.520
We actually had a karaoke night.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.080
Pretty much every night and we sang lots

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.280
of Kelly Clarkson.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.113
- Yes!

00:02:15.113 --> 00:02:16.707
- Especially, "Since You've Been Gone."

00:02:16.707 --> 00:02:19.290
And another really meaningful thing for us

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:21.150
was that we were able
to raise twelve-thousand

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:23.010
dollars for the Anxiety and Depression

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:24.386
Association of America.

00:02:24.386 --> 00:02:25.665
(audience cheers)

00:02:25.665 --> 00:02:28.140
Which was a really important cause for us.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:28.973
- Wow.

00:02:28.973 --> 00:02:30.120
You're doing something cool, that you love

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.020
and also helping people.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.430
That's amazing.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.660
Way to go, ladies!

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.070
Your purpose is magical

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.326
and good luck with the future Olympics.

00:02:37.326 --> 00:02:38.159
Everybody.

00:02:38.159 --> 00:02:40.230
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:41.370
It's so cool what y'all've done.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.670
Congratulations on
breaking that world record.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:45.570
That's not all, though.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.670
Our season long partner Pilot Pin Makers

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.280
the G2, the go to pin of
the Kelly Clarkson show.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.770
Want to honor truly unstoppable people.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.970
Just like y'all.

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:56.220
So, they'll be writing
a check in your honor.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.875
To the Anxiety and Depression Association

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:00.283
of America, for one-thousand dollars.

00:03:00.283 --> 00:03:01.777
(audience cheers)

00:03:01.777 --> 00:03:03.277
- Aw, thank you.

00:03:03.277 --> 00:03:05.430
- [Kelly] Thank you ladies, so much.

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:06.884
You're so tough.

00:03:06.884 --> 00:03:09.213
I love it, thank you for coming on.

